text Naranja_NewIsland_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_0818F6A2 {
    "WALLACE, this town’s GYM LEADER, is a\npowerful TRAINER.\pHe’s rumored to be the best in the\nwhole HOENN region.\pBut the ELITE FOUR...\pThey’re said to be even stronger than\nWALLACE. How strong could they be?"
}

text Naranja_NewIsland_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_0818F770 {
    "Everyone in town has taken refuge\nand won’t come out of their homes.\pThis weather..\nCould it be the prelude to something?"
}

text Naranja_NewIsland_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_0818F7EA {
    "Whenever, wherever, and whatever\nhappens, I will always be friends with\lPOKéMON.\pBecause it’s fun to be with POKéMON!"
}

text Naranja_NewIsland_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_0818F860 {
    "I don’t know why...\nBut... I’m really scared..."
}
